

STARTUP AUDIO NOTICE
--------------------
The project-supplied startup soundtrack is packaged as an application asset for
one automatic playback at process launch and is released automatically at end
of file. The application UI intentionally exposes no in-app mute, stop, skip,
or delete control for this brief. Android audio focus, phone calls, Bluetooth,
and other operating-system audio policies may still interrupt playback; the
application cannot override those platform controls safely.
